%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 27176f54fda69394db58a8c649002f7e, type: 3}
  m_Name: Experience Subtitles
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: DroneDDW.Experience::DroneDDW.Experience.SubtitleTable
  _entries:
  - _clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8bb80824274bae1c6f06c58676e12ab7, type: 3}
    _speaker: 
    _speakerColor: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
    _text: 'Hi and welcome! I''m your guide today. You don''t need any experience with
      VR: I''ll show you everything, step by step.'
  - _clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 148ca3a932b0e86016c20d374f2f6361, type: 3}
    _speaker: 
    _speakerColor: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
    _text: Before we start, let me introduce some people from the neighborhood.
  - _clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 310f6e811274c269e354a882060a60ec, type: 3}
    _speaker: 
    _speakerColor: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
    _text: This is their neighborhood. The slider has three versions of its future,
      from nature to efficiency. Look around and listen to what the neighbors have
      to say.
  - _clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b9ecaee922b372541a1ece881ad14072, type: 3}
    _speaker: 
    _speakerColor: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
    _text: We're back in the real world. Thanks for helping us think about the future of
      our neighborhoods.
  - _clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9bc6ba8a4cf8db1eca260eac9d9387c4, type: 3}
    _speaker: 
    _speakerColor: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
    _text: That's all! You can take off the headset now.
  - _clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f21bad1c7f72723e1c9ee2d5bd349eb6, type: 3}
    _speaker: 
    _speakerColor: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
    _text: Do you see the see-through hands in front of you? Put your own hands in
      the same place, so they match.
  - _clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d6eb481db44619319f33b582e873c350, type: 3}
    _speaker: 
    _speakerColor: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
    _text: Move your hands slowly until they line up with the see-through hands.
  - _clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9a3e8ed8f5212a287811ebd7a0446541, type: 3}
    _speaker: 
    _speakerColor: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
    _text: Perfect, I can see your hands.
  - _clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 71fdb6046cff44b2a55b4bbe4aa5eac3, type: 3}
    _speaker: 
    _speakerColor: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
    _text: On the table is a slider. Push it with your finger and watch what happens
      to me.
  - _clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3d0264fd084dcc24b12fbb9e6341f921, type: 3}
    _speaker: 
    _speakerColor: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
    _text: Try touching the handle of the slider on the table and moving it side
      to side.
  - _clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ad33e2cdc4639ee7d9df1f517fa3e327, type: 3}
    _speaker: 
    _speakerColor: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
    _text: Great! See how I change?
  - _clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: adf284525c96c79cbc904eacb1849250, type: 3}
    _speaker: 
    _speakerColor: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
    _text: Pick the look you like best for me, then press and hold the button in
      front of the slider until the countdown finishes.
  - _clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 31478ae1063a390ab768a7a9f4c6e03d, type: 3}
    _speaker:
    _speakerColor: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
    _text: Keep your hand on the button until the countdown finishes.
  - _clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 1919c6a3f333b8cdf7910b578640eec0, type: 3}
    _speaker: 
    _speakerColor: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
    _text: 'Nice, that''s my new look! That''s how you''ll choose later on: slide,
      then hold.'
  - _clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d0b309f634ed72481cca60a6db0c0980, type: 3}
    _speaker: 
    _speakerColor: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
    _text: When you've found the version you like best, hold the button to lock in
      your choice.
  - _clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c4561206c3e0669e1719e90819068c43, type: 3}
    _speaker: 
    _speakerColor: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
    _text: Thank you! Your choice is saved.
  - _clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: fe8ca3c9ec3b8811d7cfc2b73ffce21b, type: 3}
    _speaker: Grandma
    _speakerColor: {r: 0.9137255, g: 0.7529412, b: 0.30980393, a: 1}
    _text: I come to the pond every evening to feed my ducks. I hope it stays just
      like this.
  - _clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5cf76883082c6505d1f8ea5cfa344d16, type: 3}
    _speaker: Student
    _speakerColor: {r: 0.35686275, g: 0.60784316, b: 0.8352941, a: 1}
    _text: I walk her here every day. Honestly, this park could use a bit of an upgrade.
  - _clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7a6b0551a14c43b66af955883949572f, type: 3}
    _speaker: Worker
    _speakerColor: {r: 0.9019608, g: 0.49411765, b: 0.13333334, a: 1}
    _text: That lamp post by the path has been dark for a week. I'm waiting on a
      part.
